  "prefLabel": "Fis 1109.02 Forms",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Fis 1109.02 Forms. Whenever a person is required to complete a written or electronic form, the following shall apply:\n\n(a) Forms shall be filled out completely;\n\n(b) Forms shall be completed in a legible manner; and\n\n(c) All statements made on the form shall be true to the best information and belief of the person making the statement.\n\nSource. #12785, eff 5-22-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/fis1100.html"
